.TH focusforge-cli-history 1  "history 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-history \- List, delete or compact a project\*(Aqs checkpoints. Every history operation is reachable through this command, headless
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli history\fR [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List, delete or compact a project\*(Aqs checkpoints. Every history operation is reachable through this command, headless
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-history\-list(1)
List every visible checkpoint, newest first
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-history\-delete(1)
Delete one checkpoint: it is hidden, and dropped from the project once no visible checkpoint is built on it; its space is reclaimed by `history compact`. Refuses the last visible checkpoint
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-history\-compact(1)
Rewrite the project to its live checkpoints only and report the bytes reclaimed
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-history\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.1
